### grep fed from both a pipe and a file
ls /etc | grep conf < filelist.txt
>>> SC2010 1:1
>>> SC2259 1:21

### quoted heredoc body has no real consumer
date | cat <<'EOT'
literal $(cat) here
EOT
>>> SC2259 1:14

### here-string on a piped stage
uptime | grep load <<< "load average"
>>> SC2259 1:20

### unquoted heredoc with a substitution consumer
date | cat <<EOT
captured: $(cat)
EOT
>>> none

### fd duplication makes the stage undeterminable
journalctl | grep fail 2>&1 < saved.log
>>> none

### plain pipeline without input redirection
ps aux | grep sshd
>>> SC2009 1:1
